    "chunk_text": ". Hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe wundorlice. Wi\u00f0 earena sare, eft gelice \u00feon \u00fee herbufan gecweden is, genim \u00fea ylcan sealfe hluttre, drype on \u00fe\u00e6t Wundorlice hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 miltan sare, foxes lungen on hattre \u00e6scan gesoden & \u00e6r gecnucud & to drence gedon, \u00fea miltan Wi\u00f0 weartan, genim foxes sceallan, gegnid swi\u00fee oft \u00fe\u00e6rmid \u00fea weartan. Hra\u00fee hyt hy tobrece\u00fe & onweg ade\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 nearwre sworetunge, foxes lungen gesoden & on geswettum wine gedon & geseald, wundorlice Wi\u00f0 sare cyrnlu, foxes sceallan genim & gnid mid gelome. Hra\u00fee hi beo\u00f0 hale. Wi\u00f0 gomena sare, foxes sina genim & on hunige gew\u00e6t & gnid mid \u00fea goman swi\u00fee oft. Sona him by\u00fe sel \u00fe\u00e6s broces. Wi\u00f0 heafodece, genim foxes gecynd, ymfoh \u00fe\u00e6t heafod utan. Hra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s heafodes sar by\u00fe awegafyrred. To wif\u00feingum, foxes t\u00e6gles se ytem\u00e6sta d\u00e6l on earm ahangen, \u00feu gelyfest \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis sy to wif\u00feingum Wi\u00f0 li\u00feadle, genim cwicenne fox & seo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea ban ane beon l\u00e6fed, astige \u00fe\u00e6rin gelomlice, & in Wundorlice hit h\u00e6le\u00fe. & \u00e6ghwylce geare \u00feys fultum he him sceal gegearwian; & ele do \u00fe\u00e6rto \u00f0onne he hine seo\u00f0e, & his Wi\u00f0 earena sare, genim foxes geallan,",
